	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratia et pax a deo patre, <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName> ornatissime.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Nosti fortassis <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>ecclesiarum et doctorum contentiones mihi molestissimas esse, potissimum ea, quę <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>de coena dominica multos exercuit neque parum multos offendit satana unde<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>cunque occasionem arripiente, quod imbecillis obtrudat.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Et cum mihi visum sit <lb xml:id="p1z5"/><persName ref="p1974">Lutherum</persName> nostras ecclesias immerito scriptis suis non suggillare modo, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>verum etiam convitiis et calumniis exagitare, commovit me, ut tandem illi <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>et <persName ref="p2095">Melanchthoni</persName> scriberem<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Die beiden Briefe sind nicht erhalten.</note> nos immerito traduci; nam nobis <persName ref="p2095">Melanchtonis</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>scripta in Locis communibus de coena domini<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><bibl source="b441">MO</bibl> XXI 476-481.</note> placere neque quenquam vel verbum <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>contra ea loqui; nos quoque eiusdem esse sententię et tuis scriptis satis <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>testari posse, quam non nuda signa statuamus, et si <persName ref="p1974">Luthero</persName> cum <persName ref="p2095">Melanchtone</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>conveniat, nobis tunc bene cum utrisque convenire; proinde ecclesiam Christi, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>liberatoris nostri, respiciendam esse et omni opera in hoc incumbendum, ut <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>nomen contentionis aboleatur, adhibita quoque obtestatione, ut commune bonum <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>promoveatur; nam alias abunde hostium adversus ecclesiam grassari, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>et nos proscindere<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>Vor</hi> proscindere <hi>gestrichenes</hi> non.</note> desinant etc.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p1974">Lutherus</persName> nihil, at <persName ref="p2095">Melanchton</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>humanissime respondit<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Am 25. Februar (Bern StA, B III 31, 37; <bibl source="b422">MBW</bibl> 3176).</note> et inter reliqua sic scripsit ad me: „<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Quod interrogas de coena domini<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>Vor</hi> domini <hi>gestrichenes</hi> de coena.</note>: Certe non probo idola, quę <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>defendunt sacrificuli, hostes vestrarum et nostrarum ecclesiarum, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>et diligentissime antiquitatem inquisivi.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Quanquam autem apud nos <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>alii aliis durius aut horridius loquuntur<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>Vor</hi> loquuntur <hi>gestrichenes</hi> loquuntur.</note>, pręsertim <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>cum exarserunt contentiones,<pb type="edition" next="115"/> tamen eruditiores hoc, quod scripsi, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>sentiunt et fere sic loquuntur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Deum oremus communibus votis, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>ut omnia scandala praesertim ex nostris ecclesiis auferat et <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>gloriam filii sui ornet et illustret.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, vir optime; scribam <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>alias, si postulabis, copiosius etc.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="de">Datum die 25. februarii“ etc.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Hęc te, mi <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, celare nolui; nam vides, quibus verbis et <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>epithetis<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d"><hi>Korrigiert aus</hi> epitetis.</note> <persName ref="p2095">Melanchton</persName> ornet Lutheranorum formam loquendi, quod <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>eam duram et horridam referat.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Proinde mihi videtur hunc <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>virum a vobis minime negligendum, qui vere concordię studere <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>experitur; nescio, quid intercessores promoverint; ego arbitror unam <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>meam epistolam haud infeliciter missam etc.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Ego observabo <persName ref="p2095">Melanchton<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>em</persName>; nam pium pectus agnosco et merito venerabor ipsumque <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>ad plura scribendum solicitabo.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Velim eiusmodi quoque a vobis fieri, <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>quo omnes offensę tollerentur; nam credo post <persName ref="p1974">Lutheri</persName> obitum <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>omnes eius libros a convitiis repurgari<note xml:id="fne" type="footnote" n="e"><hi>Vor</hi> repurgari <hi>gestrichenes</hi> e.</note>, quo posteritas a contagio<lb xml:id="p1z36"/>ne libera existat.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Quicquid fiat, paci omnes studere conveniet; nam <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>non unius, sed multorum periculum agitur.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Eadem itaque mente praediti <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>simus etc.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Tu, quęso, si quid aliud tibi videatur, rescribe, aut id<note xml:id="fnf" type="footnote" n="f"><hi>Vielleicht irrtümlich statt</hi> si.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>hęc tibi adprobantur, et hoc significato etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Nescio, quid <persName ref="p20225">rex</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z40"/><placeName ref="l832">Galliarum</placeName><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">König <persName ref="p20225">Franz I.</persName></note> conetur.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Ego magnas turbas fore coniicio anno posteriore.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z41"/>Verum precibus vigilemus et nostrum regem Christum imploremus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Ipse <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>nos tueri dignetur, in quo fortes simus, ut hos[!] <persName ref="p21166">Erynnes</persName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Vgl. oben <ref target="file11763">Nr. 1718</ref>, Anm. 6.</note>, quicquid moliantur, <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>non moremur, duntaxat innocentię, paci et sanctimonię studeamus; <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>tunc felicem nobis prospiciet exitum et tutum receptum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><pb type="scan" next="122v."/><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Habuit apud nos <persName ref="p2810">Erasmus</persName><note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><persName ref="p2810">Erasmus Ritter</persName>.</note> gravem causam cum quodam calumniatore; <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>sed obtinuit <persName ref="p2810">Erasmus</persName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Zum Ausgang des Konflikts's zwischen <persName ref="p2810">Ritter</persName> und <persName ref="p5186">Adam Heinricher</persName> s. unten <ref target="file11787">Nr. 1741</ref>, 2-48.</note>.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Inde concionatores suam ferociam <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>remittunt et paci quoque student.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Doctrina bene procedit; nihil scio <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>culpare.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Populus universus cum proceribus concors a solida <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>et hactenus tradita sententia et institutis patrum, <persName ref="p1391">Berchtoldi</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p1391">Berchtold Haller</persName>.</note>, <lb xml:id="p2z6"/><persName ref="p5497">Francisci</persName><note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><persName ref="p5497">Franz Kolb</persName>.</note>, sive mavis <persName ref="p4091">Zvinglii</persName>, qui hos instituit, nihil plane <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>deflectimus eoque minus, quod in suspicionem venere alicuius <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>innovationis.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Boni ęquique consulamus omnia, ut modo pax et <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>decor ecclesię non offendatur etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Valete omnes docti <placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z10"/>Deus adiuvet vestros conatus, qui ad illustrandam eius gloriam <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>semper sancte invigilatis, meque habete commendatum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8011">Gvaltherus</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>sibi parcat, ne nimio studio fortassis succumbat, quo nos ipsum <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>diu superstitem habeamus etc.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Significato quoque, num Biblia<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Gemeint ist die im Frühjahr 1543 erschienene "Biblia sacrosancta" (<bibl>BZD</bibl> C 319f); vgl. <bibl source="b15">HBBW XII</bibl> <ref target="file11747">[Nr. 1702]</ref>, S. 272, 8-17 und oben <ref target="file11757">Nr. 1712</ref>.</note> sit ex<lb xml:id="p2z14"/>pedita,<pb type="edition" next="116"/> in qua et <persName ref="p8171">Theodorus</persName><note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName>.</note> et <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanus</persName> laborarunt.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Omnes saluta meo nomine.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale cum universa familia optime.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z15"/>Datum <placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName>, 29. die martii anno etc. 43.</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la">Tuus <persName ref="p3700">Eberardus a Rumlang</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse darunter:]</note>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la">Integerrimo et vigi<lb xml:id="p2z16"/>lantissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho<note xml:id="fng" type="footnote" n="g"><hi>Vielleicht als</hi> <persName ref="p495">Henricho</persName> <hi>zu lesen.</hi></note> Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurino</placeName> pastori primario, patrono suo semper co<lb xml:id="p2z17"/>lendo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="de">An Meister <persName ref="p495">Heinrich Bullinger</persName>.</s>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
